                <mxCell id="b2" value="①-2 步进式推导（:58,:94-95）&lt;br&gt;ssm 1,048,576 ÷ (128步进 × K页 2,048) = 1,048,576 ÷ 262,144 = 4&lt;br&gt;⇒ 块大小 = 128 × 4 = 512（步进是基数，不是结果！）&lt;br&gt;assert：K 页 2,048 × 512 = ssm 1,048,576 ✓ 精确铺满 :94-97" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fce4ec;strokeColor=#c62828;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" parent="1" vertex="1">
